Обычно один предмет из: [](item://minecraft:netherrack), [](item://minecraft:nether_quartz_ore), [](item://minecraft:crimson_nylium),
[](item://minecraft:warped_nylium), [](item://minecraft:nether_wart_block), [](item://minecraft:warped_wart_block);
\
Как правило, один предмет из: [](item://minecraft:soul_sand), [](item://minecraft:soul_soil), [](item://minecraft:basalt),
[](item://minecraft:blackstone), [](item://minecraft:gravel), [](item://minecraft:bone_block), [](item://minecraft:gilded_blackstone);
Иногда один предмет из: [](item://minecraft:glowstone_dust), [](item://minecraft:magma_block), [](item://minecraft:glowstone), [](item://minecraft:shroomlight);
\
Изредка один предмет из: [](item://minecraft:obsidian), [](item://minecraft:crying_obsidian), [](item://minecraft:ancient_debris);

**Добыча**: 2–4× [](item://minecraft:nautilus_shell)
и с шансом 40%% — [](item://minecraft:heart_of_the_sea),
а также обычная добыча древнего стража;

**Добыча**: 1–2× [](item://minecraft:shulker_shell) и
с шансом 10%% — [](item://minecraft:chorus_flower)
 или [](item://minecraft:spire_armor_trim_smithing_template);
